# Claude Code session files and local tooling
.claude-local/
# ⚠ `.claude/*` and NOT `.claude/`. With a trailing slash git never descends into the directory, so
# a later negation cannot re-include anything inside it. The glob form is what makes the exception
# below actually work.
.claude/*
# The review-gate definitions are TRACKED. They used to live only in `~/.claude/commands/` with a
# hand-copied backup in `.claude-local/commands/` — unversioned, invisible to any reader, and 4 of
# the 8 had silently drifted apart. Claude Code reads project commands from here, so tracking them
# means exactly one copy, which is also the copy a reviewer can read. Settings stay ignored: they
# carry machine-local paths and permissions.
!.claude/commands/

# Local MCP tooling (standalone repo, not part of the math publication)
imap-email-mcp/

# OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Lean 4 / Lake ---
# Ignore the build artifacts and local toolchain
.lake/
build/
lean_packages/
# Bytecode and intermediate C files
*.olean
*.ilean
*.c
# Lake trace files (sometimes missed by .lake/ entry)
.lake.trace

# build / session logs (transient diagnostics)
*.log

# Python bytecode cache (tools/)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Generated diagram artifacts (regenerate via tools/render/*.py)
tools/render/*.svg
